<title>ESTONIA: UHISPANK PROFIT FORECAST DUE ON SEPTEMBER 4.</title>
<headline>UHISPANK PROFIT FORECAST DUE ON SEPTEMBER 4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank said on Tuesday that it will release its new profit forecast on September 4.</p>
<p>In a statement the bank said it will also release its audited bank and group first half report on August 29.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
